 embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/BaddCompani/status/1134818261290299392\">https://x.com/BaddCompani/status/1134818261290299392</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1134946464722014211</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1134946464722014211\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2019-06-01T22:14:58Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>11</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1134947135156305920":{"a":"<p>@BaddCompani @JennaLeeTV Another thing I learned along this winding path is not to follow accounts that are constantly posting divisive nonsense words that don&#x27;t mean anything. They are throwing knives at your face to sell you ointment. Let them throw at someone else for your sanity.</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1134947135156305920</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1134947135156305920\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2019-06-01T22:17:37Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1134965353191215105":{"a":"<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vcIpujxC0oo\">YouTube</a></p>\n<div class=\"embed embed-youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/vcIpujxC0oo\" title=\"YouTube\" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"></iframe><p class=\"embed-fallback\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vcIpujxC0oo\">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div>","m":"<h1>Post 1134965353191215105</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1134965353191215105\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2019-06-01T23:30:01Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>zxx</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1134965411244412928":{"a":"<p>RT @IndianaHistory: Be